    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/814be9dc82ae6777364e02df1483a111.poster.avif?t=1753500004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/814be9dc82ae6777364e02df1483a111.webm?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/814be9dc82ae6777364e02df1483a111.mp4?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/4a8c3c396ae89b82a39b0195e0b7c2a9.poster.avif?t=1753500004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/4a8c3c396ae89b82a39b0195e0b7c2a9.webm?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/4a8c3c396ae89b82a39b0195e0b7c2a9.mp4?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world on the brink of destruction, one unlikely hero steps forward. KIDD, a young martial artist as swift with punches and kicks as he is with delivering your pizza, is humanity\u2019s last hope. <i>Pizza Kidd</i> pulses with the spirit and edginess of 90s anime and the grit of classic arcade brawlers of the same era, blending beautifully detailed 16-bit pixel art with fast-paced, responsive combat. This isn\u2019t just another &quot;indie&quot; game\u2014it\u2019s an electrifying homage to a golden era, crafted with love and modern flair to keep things feeling fresh yet familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/eeca12a976a72bede2792896f464ac0c.webp?t=1753500004\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Santos, the sinister architect behind the city's destruction, now commands an army of nightmares: creepy creature clones, zombified scarecrow ninjas that strike without warning, drone bots that patrol the gates, and towering monstrous behemoths that crush everything in their path. The streets are crawling with terror, but KIDD\u2019s mission is clear\u2014recover the 8 sacred seed stones, harness their power, and put an end to Santos' reign of madness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/b3102a697464aa62419e75326008640f.poster.avif?t=1753500004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/b3102a697464aa62419e75326008640f.webm?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/b3102a697464aa62419e75326008640f.mp4?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/1d9a86d2217ba391e2de5d504869155f.webp?t=1753500004\" /></div><strong><br><br>Unleash the Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>High-Impact Combat</strong>: Fast, responsive attacks, air juggling, and long chain combos for intense gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Side-Scrolling Adventure</strong>: Expansive 2D levels with skill-based, fighting-style special moves. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Retro Pixel Brilliance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Vivid 16-Bit Art</strong>: Hand-drawn, comic-style pixel art with detailed stages, big character sprites, and explosive effects. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sound that Hits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Arcade Crunch Sound Design</strong>: Satisfying impact with every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Epic Soundtrack by Kevin Ripley</strong>: Original music that amplifies the energy and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/321ee1837572f3d66924692ef8194605.webp?t=1753500004\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/c8c3797d2b7f4883d8c02327a07f4afd.poster.avif?t=1753500004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/c8c3797d2b7f4883d8c02327a07f4afd.webm?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/c8c3797d2b7f4883d8c02327a07f4afd.mp4?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/71c4300462da4b10f4ba9cb267fb221e.avif?t=1753500004\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>#PIZZAKIDD</i></strong>*Please note:<strong>\u00a0The Pizza Kidd Steam demo is still in active development.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/814be9dc82ae6777364e02df1483a111.poster.avif?t=1753500004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/814be9dc82ae6777364e02df1483a111.webm?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/814be9dc82ae6777364e02df1483a111.mp4?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/4a8c3c396ae89b82a39b0195e0b7c2a9.poster.avif?t=1753500004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/4a8c3c396ae89b82a39b0195e0b7c2a9.webm?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/4a8c3c396ae89b82a39b0195e0b7c2a9.mp4?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world on the brink of destruction, one unlikely hero steps forward. KIDD, a young martial artist as swift with punches and kicks as he is with delivering your pizza, is humanity\u2019s last hope. <i>Pizza Kidd</i> pulses with the spirit and edginess of 90s anime and the grit of classic arcade brawlers of the same era, blending beautifully detailed 16-bit pixel art with fast-paced, responsive combat. This isn\u2019t just another &quot;indie&quot; game\u2014it\u2019s an electrifying homage to a golden era, crafted with love and modern flair to keep things feeling fresh yet familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/eeca12a976a72bede2792896f464ac0c.webp?t=1753500004\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Santos, the sinister architect behind the city's destruction, now commands an army of nightmares: creepy creature clones, zombified scarecrow ninjas that strike without warning, drone bots that patrol the gates, and towering monstrous behemoths that crush everything in their path. The streets are crawling with terror, but KIDD\u2019s mission is clear\u2014recover the 8 sacred seed stones, harness their power, and put an end to Santos' reign of madness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/b3102a697464aa62419e75326008640f.poster.avif?t=1753500004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/b3102a697464aa62419e75326008640f.webm?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/b3102a697464aa62419e75326008640f.mp4?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/1d9a86d2217ba391e2de5d504869155f.webp?t=1753500004\" /></div><strong><br><br>Unleash the Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>High-Impact Combat</strong>: Fast, responsive attacks, air juggling, and long chain combos for intense gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Side-Scrolling Adventure</strong>: Expansive 2D levels with skill-based, fighting-style special moves. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Retro Pixel Brilliance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Vivid 16-Bit Art</strong>: Hand-drawn, comic-style pixel art with detailed stages, big character sprites, and explosive effects. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sound that Hits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Arcade Crunch Sound Design</strong>: Satisfying impact with every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Epic Soundtrack by Kevin Ripley</strong>: Original music that amplifies the energy and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/321ee1837572f3d66924692ef8194605.webp?t=1753500004\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/c8c3797d2b7f4883d8c02327a07f4afd.poster.avif?t=1753500004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/c8c3797d2b7f4883d8c02327a07f4afd.webm?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/c8c3797d2b7f4883d8c02327a07f4afd.mp4?t=1753500004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/71c4300462da4b10f4ba9cb267fb221e.avif?t=1753500004\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>#PIZZAKIDD</i></strong>*Please note:<strong>\u00a0The Pizza Kidd Steam demo is still in active development.</strong></p>",
